+             column  Message
+             column  Remarque
+             row  `Expectation(expected, found)`  1  _`found` was found when `expected` was expected_  une fin de ligne mal formée ; les deux sont des `Char`
+             row  `Version(value)`  2  _the HTTP version `value` was invalid_
+             row  `Host(value)`  3  _the host `value` was missing or invalid_
+             row  `UriTooLong`  4  _the request line exceeded the maximum length_  `maxRequestLine` ; un serveur y répond par `414`
